  attribute benefit:String="Retain independent Scheme-coordinate versus real C-layout assertions while using simple offsetof member syntax accepted by the supported C implementation. Resolve the observed MSVC fixture expression failure without deleting an assertion or changing an expected value. Actual remote MSVC result is not inferred from local Clang";
  attribute addedCost:String="Fifty generated expressions spell array base, literal index and sizeof(actual element); all are compile-time typedef bounds. No runtime allocation, object layout, root scan, native build profile or production code-generation cost is added. Reuse exact existing production binaries/generated products";
